# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify SPA routing.
#
# GUIForge is a single-page app: it has no server to render /anything, so every
# path must serve index.html and let the client take over. Without this rule a
# refresh on any URL other than "/" returns a 404.
#
# The 200 (rather than 301) keeps the address bar unchanged.
/*    /index.html   200
